WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.236
LENGTH is useful because text problems are not
always visually obvious Boundary

00:00:06.262 --> 00:00:12.264
spaces and repeated internal spaces increase the
character count Comparing

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:16.501
length before and after cleaning can help confirm
that your transformation is doing what you

00:00:16.514 --> 00:00:22.453
expect Think of LENGTH as a diagnostic function
during data preparation
